1
00:00:05,858 --> 00:00:06,988
(Penny:)So how was work today?

2
00:00:07,159 --> 00:00:10,529
(Leonard:)Well, I spent most of the afternoon
growing isotopically pure crystals...

3
00:00:10,696 --> 00:00:12,726
(Leonard:)...for neutrino detection.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,490
(Penny:)That sounds like fun.

5
00:00:17,202 --> 00:00:20,332
- Yeah, it was.
- Oh, good, I guessed right.

6
00:00:22,374 --> 00:00:25,104
- Who you talking to?
- Oh, just this guy I met at school.

7
00:00:25,277 --> 00:00:28,007
(Leonard:)Oh, great. We're still dating, right?

8
00:00:29,181 --> 00:00:33,211
(Penny:)Relax, he's just a friend. We're doing
an oral report together. He's really nice.

9
00:00:33,385 --> 00:00:36,715
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, what was that?
I had a little stroke after "oral."

10
00:00:37,623 --> 00:00:38,993
(Penny:)Would you stop?

11
00:00:40,392 --> 00:00:42,722
He moved here from London.
He doesn't know anybody.

12
00:00:42,895 --> 00:00:46,725
(Leonard:)Oh, good, an English accent,
the sexiest accent you can have.

13
00:00:46,899 --> 00:00:48,459
(Penny:)No, that's not true.

14
00:00:48,634 --> 00:00:51,464
(Penny:)There's French, there's Italian.

15
00:00:51,637 --> 00:00:53,897
(Penny:)No, you're right, it's the best.

16
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:57,400
- Did you tell him you have a boyfriend?
- It didn't come up.

17
00:00:57,576 --> 00:00:59,136
(Leonard:)Maybe you should tell him.

18
00:00:59,311 --> 00:01:01,021
(Penny:)What am I supposed to say?

